336
23:14.886 --> 23:15.887
Get out! Go on!

337
23:16.774 --> 23:18.075
I have something to discuss with Ta.

338
23:21.758 --> 23:22.759
Get out!

339
23:26.800 --> 23:27.801
Oh!

340
23:31.395 --> 23:32.396
Wait a second.

341
23:34.371 --> 23:37.582
Is that a new hairstyle for tonight's event?

342
23:38.500 --> 23:39.501
Well then...

343
23:40.440 --> 23:41.760
Let's go somewhere after the event tonight.

344
23:43.454 --> 23:44.840
Of course, Director.

345
23:45.107 --> 23:46.720
We haven't done anything in two weeks.

346
23:47.411 --> 23:49.300
I've been dying to feel your touch again.

347
23:53.150 --> 23:54.840
I didn't know you could talk so dirty.

348
23:55.742 --> 23:56.743
I've never heard you talk like that before.

349
23:57.859 --> 24:00.160
Don't you like it, Director? I'm sorry.

350
24:00.206 --> 24:01.207
Of course I do.

351
24:03.304 --> 24:04.305
You should talk like that more often.

352
24:06.083 --> 24:07.084
It's such a turn-on.

353
24:09.560 --> 24:10.561
Director?

354
24:12.368 --> 24:14.169
Could I have a drink, please?

355
24:17.307 --> 24:18.308
Of course.

356
24:20.211 --> 24:21.480
Someone just gave me a bottle of Moët.

357
24:22.419 --> 24:24.640
Let's celebrate your return with a drink.

358
25:12.142 --> 25:13.143
You know, Ta,

359
25:14.158 --> 25:15.159
I have to tell you something.

360
25:16.500 --> 25:19.180
I missed you like crazy while you were away.

361
25:21.587 --> 25:23.040
I missed those lips of yours.

362
25:28.958 --> 25:31.240
Let me go catch up on my work first, Director.

363
25:36.366 --> 25:37.367
Ta?

364
25:40.000 --> 25:41.400
I'll see you at the event tonight.

365
25:59.016 --> 26:00.017
Hey, Auntie.

366
26:03.139 --> 26:06.360
What's with that hairstyle? It looks so weird.

367
26:06.824 --> 26:08.125
It's so messy.

368
26:10.430 --> 26:13.200
It's a modern hairstyle, so it's meant to look a little messy.

369
26:13.592 --> 26:15.000
Some people just don't get it.

370
26:17.368 --> 26:18.960
And what time do you call this?

371
26:19.302 --> 26:20.720
You're only just showing up for work?

372
26:22.720 --> 26:24.300
I went to see the director.

373
26:24.982 --> 26:26.891
- About what? - We haven't named it yet.

374
26:27.163 --> 26:29.164
Let's just say it was personal.

375
26:30.827 --> 26:32.560
This is a government office.

376
26:33.187 --> 26:34.680
We're civil servants.

377
26:34.966 --> 26:36.640
And these are official working hours.

378
26:36.923 --> 26:39.124
Yet you're using them for personal matters?

379
26:40.744 --> 26:43.620
Well, I'm working for the director directly.

380
26:43.798 --> 26:47.000
I have to do whatever he tells me to.

381
26:47.272 --> 26:50.760
Wow, talk about shameless butt-kissing.

382
26:50.995 --> 26:54.730
I bet you've licked him all over by now.

383
26:56.120 --> 26:58.240
Well, everyone wants to suck up to the director.

384
26:58.595 --> 27:00.120
Don't tell me you two...

385
27:00.230 --> 27:02.120
don't want to kiss up to him, too.

386
27:03.859 --> 27:04.860
We…

387
27:05.240 --> 27:07.960
are civil servants with professional ethics.

388
27:09.180 --> 27:10.181
As for you,

389
27:10.576 --> 27:11.840
