390
27:12.518 --> 27:13.640
and you think you can climb the ladder?

391
27:14.166 --> 27:15.767
You'll come crashing down soon enough.

392
27:16.760 --> 27:18.000
Take my advice.

393
27:18.438 --> 27:20.640
Don't even think about getting promoted this way.

394
27:20.649 --> 27:21.650
It won't get you anywhere.

395
27:24.315 --> 27:26.640
Thank you for taking the time to warn me

396
27:26.843 --> 27:28.700
