414
28:17.275 --> 28:19.720
This project will be our party's legacy for years to come.

415
28:20.107 --> 28:22.945
It could even help us win the next election.

416
28:23.640 --> 28:24.840
That's why I think

417
28:25.240 --> 28:27.800
instead of our usual 30% kickback from each project,

418
28:28.510 --> 28:31.440
