419
28:31.926 --> 28:33.520
to ensure the highest quality of work.

420
28:57.000 --> 28:58.001
Please excuse me.

421
29:03.206 --> 29:04.207
Where are you going, ma'am?

422
29:04.486 --> 29:05.920
To wring that bitch's neck.

423
29:06.200 --> 29:08.720
Even after being gang-raped, she still hasn't learned her lesson!

424
29:11.552 --> 29:13.560
