425
29:13.620 --> 29:14.960
If there's anything you need, you can leave a message with me.

426
29:21.160 --> 29:22.900
[Ministry of Digital Finance]

427
29:51.024 --> 29:52.025
Oh!

428
29:52.680 --> 29:54.200
Minister Nopnapha is here!

429
29:54.440 --> 29:55.641
This way, ma'am.

430
29:55.720 --> 29:57.500
Minister Nopnapha is here! Make way!

431
29:57.920 --> 29:59.021
This way, ma'am.

432
30:10.795 --> 30:11.796
Aunt Nopnapha?

433
30:13.832 --> 30:14.833
Where is that bitch?

434
30:17.000 --> 30:18.001
Who?

435
30:18.776 --> 30:21.283
Don't play dumb! I'm talking about your mistress!

436
30:23.584 --> 30:26.040
She's at her desk. Why would she be here?

437
30:28.992 --> 30:30.400
But this is your desk.

438
30:33.163 --> 30:34.966
Oh, right. So it is.

439
30:36.550 --> 30:37.800
Don't mess with me!

440
30:38.640 --> 30:40.512
She's barely back at work, and you're already going at it?

441
30:40.630 --> 30:41.931
Are you really that desperate?

442
30:43.560 --> 30:45.240
Isn't that perfectly normal?

443
30:46.216 --> 30:47.650
What's all the fuss about?

444
30:48.467 --> 30:50.640
And what about that director-general position? Have you put my name forward yet?

445
30:51.614 --> 30:54.215
You think I'm going to give you that promotion now?

446
30:54.950 --> 30:56.520
You're already like this as a director.

447
30:56.704 --> 30:58.720
If you become director-general, why not just start your own harem?

448
30:59.960 --> 31:01.120
Well, can I?

449
31:01.200 --> 31:02.901
- Jenphop! - Auntie, please.

450
31:03.144 --> 31:04.145
Could you keep your voices down?

451
31:06.648 --> 31:07.960
Everyone outside can hear you.

452
31:11.891 --> 31:13.592
- I'll deal with that bitch myself! - Hey!

453
31:13.651 --> 31:14.652
Aunt Nopnapha, please don't.

454
31:17.043 --> 31:19.280
Just wait here. I'll go get her for you.

455
31:32.931 --> 31:33.932
Meow.

456
31:35.678 --> 31:37.600
What's that hairstyle Mutta's sporting?

457
31:39.704 --> 31:41.240
It's this iconic style.

458
31:41.448 --> 31:44.440
Orn-in's haircut from Mia Luang, you know?

459
31:45.040 --> 31:46.341
Oh, right.

460
31:48.139 --> 31:49.140
Come on, come on.

461
31:50.672 --> 31:52.720
Working in the civil service sure is exhausting.

462
31:53.310 --> 31:55.120
Yeah, I've been stapling all day.

463
31:59.700 --> 32:00.880
Veekit.

464
32:01.582 --> 32:03.200
You came all the way here to see me?

465
32:03.448 --> 32:05.176
Is there anything I can do for you?

466
32:06.446 --> 32:09.000
Move aside, honey. He's here to see me.

467
32:11.144 --> 32:14.645
Oh, Veekit, darling. About those documents I'm drafting for the director,

468
32:14.650 --> 32:16.680
I'll bring them to your desk as soon as they're ready.

469
32:17.187 --> 32:19.240
You two really have wild imaginations, don't you?

470
32:19.918 --> 32:21.480
Veekit, darling.

471
32:21.520 --> 32:24.240
You're here to invite me to tonight's fundraising event, aren't you?

472
32:24.392 --> 32:27.488
Okay, I accept.

473
32:27.500 --> 32:28.601
I'm actually here to see Ta.

474
32:30.300 --> 32:31.301
Move aside.

475
32:34.130 --> 32:36.131
- You're pretty full of yourself, aren't you? - Thank you.

476
32:38.384 --> 32:40.385
Ta, she wants to see you.

477
32:41.814 --> 32:42.815
Who?

478
32:46.171 --> 32:47.372
You know, the minister.

479
32:51.190 --> 32:53.200
Minister Nopnapha

480
32:53.982 --> 32:56.440
wants to speak to me privately?

481
33:00.904 --> 33:04.000
Please apologize to her for me. I'm busy.

482
33:05.542 --> 33:08.262
Wow!

483
33:08.843 --> 33:12.000
Where did you get all that nerve?

484
33:12.182 --> 33:15.000
How dare you say you're too busy for Minister Nopnapha?

485
33:17.216 --> 33:18.960
I just want to finish my work.

486
33:19.360 --> 33:21.120
I don't want to be a burden to anyone.

487
33:24.916 --> 33:28.920
Or are you afraid to face her again

488
33:29.250 --> 33:31.520
because she might slap you again?

489
33:37.155 --> 33:38.880
You've got some nerve, young lady.

490
33:39.507 --> 33:41.480
You're the first person in history

491
33:41.600 --> 33:43.680
to dare defy Minister Nopnapha.

492
33:48.200 --> 33:49.601
You did the right thing.

493
33:50.147 --> 33:52.720
Work responsibilities come first, right?

494
34:03.462 --> 34:04.463
You know,

495
34:05.430 --> 34:07.480
Mutta's been acting a little strange lately.

496
34:08.459 --> 34:10.960
She's gotten a lot fiercer.

497
34:11.707 --> 34:13.190
I thought I was the only one who noticed.

498
34:13.456 --> 34:15.960
What kind of nun taught her meditation?

499
34:16.341 --> 34:17.342
Exactly.

500
34:18.149 --> 34:21.450
Maybe that haircut changed her whole personality.

501
34:21.579 --> 34:22.640
Why don't you get one too?

502
34:23.106 --> 34:24.520
You should get one yourself.

503
34:26.019 --> 34:29.000
- What about that wagon-sized Titan? - He's not doing it. Leave him alone.

504
34:29.100 --> 34:30.101
Come on, get back to work.

505
34:34.920 --> 34:36.712
She's deliberately trying to provoke me.

506
34:37.260 --> 34:38.320
I'm glad you realize that, ma'am.

507
34:38.755 --> 34:40.150
So don't play into her hands.

508
34:41.832 --> 34:43.300
Please try to stay calm, ma'am.

509
34:44.056 --> 34:46.920
I don't want a repeat of what happened outside the ministry.

510
34:47.432 --> 34:50.080
Covering up a scandal like that isn't easy.

511
34:51.987 --> 34:53.360
Then tell me, Touch.

512
34:53.581 --> 34:55.840
What am I supposed to do with that bitch?

513
34:56.742 --> 34:58.243
She disappeared for so long.

514
34:58.743 --> 35:00.120
I thought it was all over.

515
35:00.395 --> 35:04.160
But no, she's crawled out of her grave to torment me again.

516
35:04.654 --> 35:06.880
That mistress is damn near impossible to kill!

517
35:13.654 --> 35:15.166
I have to be honest with you.

518
35:15.300 --> 35:17.320
Marital problems aren't exactly my area of expertise.

519
35:19.118 --> 35:21.160
But I don't believe in using violence.

520
35:21.822 --> 35:24.400
I believe in talking things through peacefully.

521
35:25.400 --> 35:27.601
I've tried talking to that bitch countless times.

522
35:27.880 --> 35:29.896
But she never listens to reason.

523
35:30.900 --> 35:32.320
I meant talking to the director.

524
35:34.800 --> 35:36.080
Perhaps getting a divorce

525
35:36.304 --> 35:37.840
would be the best solution.

526
35:40.784 --> 35:42.120
Congratulations

527
35:42.150 --> 35:45.000
to Minister Nopnapha and her family

528
35:45.100 --> 35:48.160
on receiving this year's Outstanding Family Award.

529
35:48.283 --> 35:52.120
You're truly a role model for families across Thailand.

530
35:52.640 --> 35:53.641
No.

531
35:54.220 --> 35:55.321
I can't get divorced.

532
36:16.512 --> 36:18.300
I call shotgun!

533
36:18.480 --> 36:20.000
Your seat's back there.

534
36:23.259 --> 36:24.260
After you.

535
36:31.907 --> 36:34.008
- Hello, Veekit. - Hello, Tetris.

536
36:34.552 --> 36:35.553
Let's go.

537
36:39.923 --> 36:42.320
Oh, Titas! Have you said hi to me yet?

538
36:43.758 --> 36:44.759
Hi.

539
36:45.822 --> 36:48.050
You're dragging down Alpha's average IQ.

540
36:48.552 --> 36:51.790
Oh, like you're such a genius, you queen!

541
36:51.843 --> 36:52.844
You're the queen!

542
36:52.860 --> 36:54.600
That's enough, both of you!

543
36:55.050 --> 36:56.451
Watch your language, both of you.

544
36:57.400 --> 37:00.240
I thought you were proud to be LGBTQ.

545
37:00.427 --> 37:02.840
So why get mad when I call you a queen, huh?

546
37:03.376 --> 37:05.891
Well, it's all about the tone, isn't it?

547
37:06.240 --> 37:07.800
How would you like it if I called you a bitch?

548
37:08.174 --> 37:09.900
- Sure, you queen! - You bitch!

549
37:09.920 --> 37:11.800
- You queen! - You bitch!

550
37:11.838 --> 37:13.520
I said stop it! Stop!

551
37:14.056 --> 37:15.200
You two just won't stop fighting.

552
37:15.808 --> 37:17.040
Can't you be nice to each other?

553
37:21.500 --> 37:22.701
- You queen! - You bitch!

554
37:22.720 --> 37:24.080
We're home now. That's enough!

555
37:24.100 --> 37:25.280
- You bitch! - Open the door.

556
37:26.000 --> 37:26.801
Go on.

557
37:26.827 --> 37:27.880
- You queen! - You bitch!

558
37:27.910 --> 37:29.120
- You queen! - You bitch!

559
37:29.300 --> 37:30.302
- You bitch! - You queen!

560
37:30.336 --> 37:31.337
- You're the bitch! - You queen!

561
37:31.500 --> 37:32.640
Hey, stop running!

562
37:33.501 --> 37:34.502
- You queen! - No, you're the bitch!

563
37:36.432 --> 37:38.200
- You queen! - No, you're the bitch!

564
37:39.300 --> 37:40.640
That's enough!

565
37:40.710 --> 37:42.600
- You queen! - I said stop calling each other names!

566
37:42.660 --> 37:44.560
These kids!

567
37:45.024 --> 37:46.025
Kids!

568
37:46.160 --> 37:48.620
Hurry up, take a shower, and come down for dinner.

569
37:48.640 --> 37:49.680
Don't make me call you twice.

570
37:51.371 --> 37:52.372
Oh!

571
37:53.072 --> 37:54.073
You're home, sweetheart.

572
37:55.667 --> 37:57.560
- Hi, Mom. - Hello, dear.

573
37:58.000 --> 38:00.720
Are you eating here or at the event?

574
38:02.160 --> 38:03.440
I'll eat at the event.

575
38:04.550 --> 38:05.800
Have you prepared my suit yet, Mom?

576
38:05.930 --> 38:08.440
It's all ready. It's in your bedroom.

577
38:08.736 --> 38:10.600
- Your house is over there. Go on. - I'll go get changed first.

578
38:12.259 --> 38:13.260
Oh, Veekit.

579
38:16.766 --> 38:18.640
I heard that bitch is back.

580
38:18.767 --> 38:20.360
Nopnapha called and told me.

581
38:22.668 --> 38:23.669
Yes.

582
38:24.000 --> 38:25.283
But I've already told her, Mom,

583
38:25.486 --> 38:27.400
not to cause any more trouble for our family.

584
38:27.420 --> 38:28.421
What?

585
38:28.493 --> 38:30.140
Dad's bitch of a mistress is back?

586
38:30.413 --> 38:31.720
I thought she'd been gone for ages.

587
38:32.000 --> 38:33.300
I thought the bitch was dead by now.

588
38:33.320 --> 38:34.640
Hey, calm down.

589
38:35.816 --> 38:39.000
She told me she'd been staying at a temple.

590
38:39.182 --> 38:40.320
Maybe she's turned over a new leaf.

591
38:41.900 --> 38:44.320
