595
38:52.861 --> 38:54.611
Hey, I told you to watch your language.

596
38:55.208 --> 38:56.700
But Tetris has a point.

597
38:57.059 --> 39:00.968
How much longer will our family have to fight

598
39:01.112 --> 39:02.700
that shameless hussy?

599
39:02.846 --> 39:04.320
What did we do to deserve this?

600
39:07.896 --> 39:08.897
What's going on here?

601
39:14.200 --> 39:15.640
She's a shameless slut, Aunt Soi!

602
39:15.896 --> 39:16.897
That's right, sweetheart.

603
39:33.379 --> 39:34.380
Director.

604
39:37.371 --> 39:38.372
Director, please.

605
39:40.710 --> 39:41.711
Director!

606
39:42.500 --> 39:43.600
What's wrong, Ta?

607
39:44.808 --> 39:46.250
Can't we do it right here, just once?

608
39:47.000 --> 39:48.500
- Director, please. - I've missed you, Ta.

609
39:48.558 --> 39:50.240
I've scheduled a stage rehearsal.

610
39:50.355 --> 39:51.600
I have to hurry.

611
39:52.240 --> 39:54.806
We've done so many events together. You don't need to rehearse.

612
39:55.320 --> 39:56.321
Director, please.

613
39:56.582 --> 39:58.720
Since this is our first time together in over a month,

614
39:59.270 --> 40:00.840
