615
40:02.070 --> 40:04.520
Let's have some fun after the event, okay?

616
40:06.125 --> 40:09.126
I can't hold back any longer, Ta.

617
40:10.280 --> 40:12.081
I'm about to explode down there.

618
40:13.107 --> 40:14.108
Ta.

619
40:16.400 --> 40:17.600
Just let me have one quick round here.

620
40:18.302 --> 40:19.520
Director, please.

621
40:20.147 --> 40:22.168
I want to see you explode all over me.

622
40:22.686 --> 40:23.800
If we do it here,

623
40:24.259 --> 40:25.520
it'll all end up on the floor.

624
40:26.067 --> 40:27.268
It will be such a waste.

625
40:28.088 --> 40:29.342
Director.

626
40:30.190 --> 40:31.520
Please be patient, okay?

627
40:32.136 --> 40:33.437
Just a few more hours.

628
40:38.725 --> 40:39.726
Okay, okay.

629
40:40.320 --> 40:41.321
I'll save it for later, then.

630
40:42.100 --> 40:43.520
I'll wait here for a bit.

631
40:44.016 --> 40:46.120
I'll go into the event first, and you'll follow me in, okay?

632
40:51.500 --> 40:53.280
After the event, we're going all out.

633
40:53.600 --> 40:54.601
The whole package!

634
41:20.342 --> 41:21.720
When I saw that you were back,

635
41:22.987 --> 41:24.300
I was so damn happy, you know?

636
41:26.600 --> 41:28.601
But if you're just going to act the same way again,

637
41:29.627 --> 41:31.472
I think you'd have been better off not coming back, Ta.

638
41:32.854 --> 41:34.300
Didn't those Buddhist teachings do you any good?

639
41:37.419 --> 41:39.920
Let me tell you something. While I was away,

640
41:40.580 --> 41:42.081
I wasn't on a meditation retreat.

641
41:42.838 --> 41:44.200
I just snuck off for a vacation.

642
41:45.000 --> 41:46.601
And I'm still in love with the director.

643
41:47.401 --> 41:49.562
I'm going to go back to doing everything we used to do together.

644
41:51.100 --> 41:53.801
I'm telling you this so you'll stop getting your hopes up.

645
41:54.504 --> 41:56.400
I don't know what you see in me,

646
41:57.424 --> 41:59.240
but the old Mutta is dead.

647
41:59.883 --> 42:01.200
I'm a new Mutta now.

648
42:02.187 --> 42:03.620
And you're not going to like this version of me.

649
42:13.403 --> 42:15.040
This project would never have been possible

650
42:15.542 --> 42:17.400
without everyone's cooperation.

651
42:17.832 --> 42:20.320
On behalf of all the civil servants,

652
42:20.642 --> 42:23.360
I'd like to take this opportunity to thank you all. Thank you.

653
42:26.280 --> 42:29.920
Next, please welcome Mr. Sirasak Santrisak,

654
42:30.024 --> 42:33.320
Deputy Permanent Secretary, to present a gift to Director Jenphop.

655
42:56.515 --> 42:57.840
Minister Nopnapha is here!

656
42:58.491 --> 43:00.920
Make way, please!

657
43:03.381 --> 43:04.520
Make way!

658
43:04.907 --> 43:05.908
This way, ma'am.

659
43:07.360 --> 43:09.161
Oh, I wasn't aware

660
43:09.462 --> 43:11.630
that the minister would be joining us.

661
43:13.520 --> 43:16.192
In that case, may I invite Minister Nopnapha

662
43:16.998 --> 43:19.550
to present the token of appreciation to Director Jenphop?

663
43:28.683 --> 43:29.684
Make way!

664
43:30.709 --> 43:31.860
This way, ma'am.

665
43:50.750 --> 43:52.651
Please go ahead and present it.

666
44:08.459 --> 44:11.880
Look at them posing together. A husband and his two wives!

667
44:13.200 --> 44:15.101
She's already slapped her outside the ministry.

668
44:15.201 --> 44:18.560
I'd love to see them have a catfight right here today.

669
44:19.562 --> 44:20.920
I don't think that's a good idea.

670
44:21.310 --> 44:23.160
There are hardly any steps here.

671
44:23.384 --> 44:26.500
It wouldn't be satisfying if someone fell down them.

672
44:27.582 --> 44:29.112
Look at the way Veekit's looking at Ta.

673
44:29.130 --> 44:31.560
He looks kind of jealous.

674
44:31.580 --> 44:34.260
- You're right. What a love square. - Everyone, please.

675
44:34.731 --> 44:36.800
Let's not gossip about the minister.

676
44:37.211 --> 44:39.560
I don't think it's appropriate.

677
44:40.400 --> 44:41.480
[You're so fake!]

678
44:42.900 --> 44:44.360
Why are you so fed up?

679
44:45.712 --> 44:47.400
Fed up, my ass!

680
44:48.763 --> 44:51.564
So when are they going to hand out the money?

681
44:52.800 --> 44:54.400
They're not giving out any money, Chuenchom.

682
44:57.182 --> 44:58.760
Excuse me, could you move aside, please?

683
45:03.771 --> 45:04.772
Mutta.

684
45:05.120 --> 45:06.500
Could you step aside a little, please?

685
45:27.174 --> 45:30.075
Thank you very much, Minister, for...

686
45:44.678 --> 45:45.680
Since I'm already here,

687
45:46.742 --> 45:48.300
I'd like to say a few words.

688
45:50.358 --> 45:51.600
Our ministry

689
45:52.118 --> 45:54.219
is responsible for managing the nation's finances.

690
45:56.200 --> 45:57.201
Honesty

691
45:57.846 --> 45:59.960
is one of our core values.

692
46:02.069 --> 46:03.400
Not just in our professional duties,

693
46:04.662 --> 46:07.440
but in every aspect of our lives.

694
46:08.518 --> 46:09.720
Take our families, for example.

695
46:10.459 --> 46:13.260
We must remain faithful to our spouses.

696
46:17.400 --> 46:18.401
And we...

697
46:20.448 --> 46:22.760
must never steal someone else's spouse.

698
46:26.800 --> 46:28.043
In fact,

699
46:29.250 --> 46:32.403
these are the most basic principles of human decency.

700
46:42.166 --> 46:43.700
That was so moving, ma'am.

701
46:44.198 --> 46:45.440
Give her a round of applause!

702
46:46.400 --> 46:48.600
Absolutely! That's so true!

703
46:53.288 --> 46:55.560
Looks like our plans for tonight are off, Director.

704
46:56.286 --> 46:57.320
I'll be going now.

705
47:10.900 --> 47:12.080
I'd like to thank

706
47:13.200 --> 47:16.880
Minister Nopnapha for those inspiring words.

707
47:17.917 --> 47:19.080
Let's give her another round of applause.

708
47:31.512 --> 47:33.080
Have you seen her new haircut?

709
47:34.558 --> 47:37.159
That hairstyle is the classic mistress look.

710
47:37.667 --> 47:40.640
It's been popular with mistresses for generations, ma'am.

711
47:45.798 --> 47:47.250
Keep an eye on Jenphop here.

712
47:48.050 --> 47:49.051
Yes, ma'am.

713
47:57.051 --> 47:58.052
Mutta.

714
48:01.052 --> 48:02.120
Mutta.

715
48:05.198 --> 48:06.520
Look at you, strutting around with that big butt.

716
48:07.534 --> 48:08.535
Why are you following me?

717
48:09.019 --> 48:11.880
Isn't your mission today to keep an eye on your husband?

718
48:12.240 --> 48:13.560
Or are you planning to slap his mistress, too?

719
48:16.032 --> 48:17.400
Let's not talk like that, Mutta.

720
48:18.033 --> 48:21.034
Let's discuss this like civilized adults.

721
48:22.888 --> 48:24.300
Civilized adults?

722
48:25.112 --> 48:27.560
I can't believe those words

723
48:28.040 --> 48:31.001
came from someone who sent men to gang-rape another woman.

724
48:32.160 --> 48:33.161
That's hilarious.

725
48:33.654 --> 48:34.655
Absolutely hilarious.

726
48:35.787 --> 48:38.600
I don't mind, though. In fact, I should thank you.

727
48:39.250 --> 48:40.480
You sent five men this time.

728
48:41.200 --> 48:42.640
Next time, make it seven.

729
48:42.987 --> 48:44.170
That'll make it even more fun.

730
48:47.864 --> 48:49.160
I underestimated you.

731
48:49.800 --> 48:51.301
I didn't think you'd be so unfazed.

732
48:53.670 --> 48:55.120
So how about we have a civilized conversation?

733
48:55.414 --> 48:56.415
Sure.

734
48:57.040 --> 48:58.160
I'll count

735
48:58.700 --> 49:00.600
how many words we can exchange before things turn ugly.

736
49:03.672 --> 49:06.328
Mutta, you bitch! You're still wearing that ring?

737
49:06.630 --> 49:07.631
Zero.

738
49:11.800 --> 49:12.801
Got it.

739
49:19.300 --> 49:22.701
Turn off the lights and CCTV cameras on the entire floor.

740
49:34.779 --> 49:37.040
With gold prices soaring past 70,000 baht per baht-weight,

741
49:38.870 --> 49:42.560
smart people make money trading stocks and Bitcoin.

742
49:43.616 --> 49:45.552
But a brainless woman like you

743
49:45.910 --> 49:48.411
still makes a living in the world's oldest profession.

744
49:50.286 --> 49:51.720
No investment required, right?

745
49:52.315 --> 49:54.760
You've had the tools of the trade since birth.

746
49:56.600 --> 49:57.800
All it takes is a little effort.

747
49:58.579 --> 50:01.240
Just a few pelvic muscle squeezes, and the job's done.

748
50:02.443 --> 50:03.880
You're absolutely pathetic.

749
50:05.160 --> 50:08.360
Because half the men in the world are still sick of their wives.

750
50:09.208 --> 50:11.040
And I happen to have certain qualities

751
50:12.222 --> 50:14.250
that an old wife like you just doesn't have.

752
50:15.100 --> 50:17.501
Why wouldn't I seize this market opportunity?

753
50:18.211 --> 50:19.440
The money's pretty good, too.

754
50:22.862 --> 50:23.863
You bitch, Mutta!

755
50:25.000 --> 50:26.080
Take that ring off right now!

756
50:31.598 --> 50:34.250
Your husband put it on my finger himself.

757
50:35.064 --> 50:36.280
Why don't you get him to take it off?

758
50:36.984 --> 50:39.080
Though he'd probably take all my clothes off, too.

759
50:39.720 --> 50:41.120
Because what he's got at home

760
50:42.595 --> 50:43.596
isn't exactly a pretty sight.

761
50:45.539 --> 50:46.760
Take it off right now!

762
50:53.550 --> 50:54.751
You bitch, Mutta!

763
51:06.102 --> 51:07.103
Remember this.

764
51:07.326 --> 51:08.327
From now on,

765
51:09.000 --> 51:10.601
you're Mutta's victim.

766
51:28.001 --> 51:29.280
- Ma'am! - What the hell?

767
51:30.528 --> 51:31.800
Don't film this! Don't film!

768
51:31.829 --> 51:33.830
You need to get the hell out of this department.

769
51:34.800 --> 51:36.601
I'll help you pack your things.

770
51:37.440 --> 51:38.441
No.

771
51:39.291 --> 51:40.292
I'm not leaving.

772
51:40.790 --> 51:41.840
How the hell am I supposed to survive without this job?

773
51:43.947 --> 51:44.948
I can sit by myself.

774
51:45.072 --> 51:46.200
I need to talk to you.

775
51:47.160 --> 51:48.161
So I have to sit here.

776
51:49.920 --> 51:53.120
When are you going to divorce her and marry me, Director?

777
51:54.160 --> 51:55.840
A cheap little mistress like her

778
51:56.480 --> 51:57.880
has messed with the wrong woman.

779
51:57.974 --> 52:00.360
The police car? What are they doing here?

780
52:01.504 --> 52:02.800
So how are you going to get back at her?
